# Reluctant Role Model: another creature you control that had counters dies. Bot1's Patched Plaything, cast from hand, enters
# with two -1/-1 counters (a 2/1). Bot2's Lightning Bolt kills it on turn 4, and Bot1 puts the two -1/-1 counters on Bot2's
# Ornithopter (0/2), which dies. Role Model itself (no counters) is unaffected.

